</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:6.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="93.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 90.63)" width="46.64em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><pre id="A4.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task: Produce a succinct summary of the following stdout and stderr logs for a
